> At[ Cosmetic Dent]ists of Houston, our[ dental] crowns and onlays are metal-free and fabricated from durable and highest quality US-made materials. For more information about crown technology, the quality of our materials and what to expect from the[ dental] crown procedure, please see D[ental] Crowns, Onlays and[ Bridges].
