Only about one-third of college professors are ten[ured faculty], and this is a[ major] cause for concern in the field. If you are hired on the[ tenure]-track in a college setting, it typically will take about three years at a junior college and seven years at a four-year college to be granted tenure. If you are working in a high school, middle school or primary school, everything is based on the state law that applies to public schools.
