The master[ suite] also had its own[ bathroom] with two double[ sinks], a[ bid]et,[ towel] warmer,[ tub]/shower and more of the great smelling[ bath] products that the Cheval properties always have. It is nice that they set you up with[ amenities] just as if it was a[ hotel], the little things like a[ towel] warmer and[ quality] bath products really make a place and bring it together for me.
