> These Stunning and Innovative Collection of New Builds are located in the vibrant new area of Lomas de[ Cab]o Roig in the city of[ Ori]huela[ Costa] between[ Alic]ante, Mur[cia] and Cartag[ena] with access to two nearby[ airports].
