The children in the[ Daisy] room have the opportunity to join in Wiggle and Roll sessions at the local[ gymnastics] club (where[ Kimber]ley is a Coach) Yog[inis] (Y[oga] for mini people)[ Dance] & Movement[ Music] and Singing sessions.
